  backup_key
  database_password
  /// One queued email (recipient, subject, body), sealed until the worker sends it, then deleted.
  email_message
  /// The secret Vercel signs its webhook deliveries with. Opened by the api only, to check a signature.
  vercel_webhook_secret
  /// The GitHub App's OAuth client secret, which GitHub hands over once, when it creates the App
